GULATION. • VENDOR SHALL BE RESPONSIBLE FOR FULL RESTORATION TO DAMAGE CAUSED DURING CONSTRUCTION PHASE. • REMOVE ALL WORK-RELATED DEBRIS. • VENDOR MUST CALL CPM MOHAMMAD ALAM AT 212 863-5971, (phone: sign in to see) EMAIL ALAMMO@HPD.NYC.GOV, OR SUPERVISOR DELLITURRI PASQUALE 212 863-5111 TO INFORM THE STARTING DATE AND THE DATES AND TIMES OF THE DIFFERENT STAGES OF WORK AND COPY OF DRAWINGS. ALTERNATIVE ENFORCEMENT PROGRAM",
